    "tidbits": [
      "Redwood Murder is 7-1 despite finishing ninth in Week 8 scoring; the league leader has now won with 100.28, 107.92, and 94.24 in consecutive weeks.",
      "Sullco MethMouths leads the league in both PF (911.26) and all-play (58-30) while sitting one game behind Redwood in the overall standings.",
      "Turbulent Ticklesh!ts owns the widest week-to-week rebound of the season: 68.08 in Week 7 to 127.46 in Week 8, a 59.38-point jump.",
      "Off Boys is 3-5 but remains #3 in PF and #3 in all-play. Its all-play expected-win mark is 5.00, two full wins above its actual record.",
      "California Un-Named Team is 6-2 with a 40-48 all-play record, the only current six-win team below .500 against the full weekly field.",
      "Flint Tropics is 1-7 despite ranking #7 in PF and #7 in all-play; opponents have scored 965.46 points against Flint through eight weeks.",
      "Week 8’s top three scores all came from Central teams: Turbulent Ticklesh!ts, Medford MountainMen, and Flint Tropics.",
      "The Space Cadets won the Gonzo/Dawg Medallion matchup by 39.92 points, Week 8’s largest margin."
