      "East: Sullco holds a two-game cushion over Simpson Sith and Your Mom, both 4-4. Space Cadets is 3-5 and still has six games remaining.",
      "West: Redwood leads California by one game and Eskimo Brothers by two. Off Boys is four games back by record but carries a top-three PF/all-play profile.",
      "Central: Ticklesh!ts leads at 5-3. Medford and Flint are 2-6 and 1-7, so their margin for error is shrinking, but no elimination claim is made here.",
